BEM-CPP third-party notice
==========================

The Sauter-Schwab region maps in src/muller_duffy.cpp follow the open-source
Bempp-cl Duffy quadrature implementation and were rewritten for the P2 Muller
reference triangle. Bempp-cl is distributed under the MIT License:

https://github.com/bempp/bempp-cl

No Bempp-cl binary dependency is required by the BEM-CPP solver.

The analytic full-SO(3) postprocessor under third_party/mstm is derived from
Daniel Mackowski's MSTM code, commit a0c982121cf9ac352531f4816639a07d814385bd.
Its MIT license is included as third_party/mstm/LICENSE. The extraction,
convention adapter, OpenMP execution, and general-T completion are described
in third_party/mstm/PROVENANCE.txt and scripts/tmatrix_so3_mstm.py.
https://github.com/dmckwski/MSTM
